---
import ArticleLayout from "../layouts/ArticleLayout.astro";
---

<ArticleLayout
  title="About"
  description="About Image Identifier — a free browser tool to check if an image looks AI-generated or real."
>
  <span slot="crumb" class="text-fg">About</span>

  <p>
    Image Identifier is a free tool that helps you check whether a photo looks AI-generated or real.
    Results are estimates and can be wrong — not legal proof.
  </p>
  <p>
    The check runs in your browser on the file you choose. Your image is not uploaded to our servers
    for analysis. The site may still load app assets over the network.
  </p>
  <p>
    Start with the <a href="/">tool</a>, skim the <a href="/faq/">FAQ</a>, or read the
    <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.
  </p>
</ArticleLayout>
